    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the cabinet decision No. CP/14/0540/523/012 dated 20th May 2014, I, JosephMichael Perera, Minister of Home Affairs, do by this order declare the year commenced from 17th September 2014 as \u201cSirAnagarika Dharmapala Year\u201d in order to commemorate 150th Birth Anniversary of Sir Anagarika Dharmapala.",
